{
  "key": 25602,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000230_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Fascinating...\r",
        "This heat is not geothermal.\n",
        "It is friction--two realities\r",
        "grinding against each other."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000230_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah. A Trainer. You regard me with\n",
        "suspicion. Yet in this world,\r",
        "I am no one of consequence.\r",
        "I am merely a scholar trying to\n",
        "understand why Sinnoh is breaking.\r",
        "These rifts leak energy. They warp\n",
        "the stone and manifest as powerful\r",
        "Totem Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000230_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "If the rifts remain unchecked,\n",
        "this world will tear itself apart.\r",
        "I made grave errors\n",
        "in another life.\r",
        "Perhaps helping you seal them may\n",
        "help balance the scales.\r",
        "Seek the Totems. Defeat them,\n",
        "and stabilize the region."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000230_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey!\n",
        "Did you see that guy in\n",
        "the dark coat down there?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000230_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "He talks like he owns the place.\r",
        "He says this energy is dangerous.\n",
        "He’s right--but he doesn’t\n",
        "know the half of it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000230_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "My old man always said true\n",
        "power demands a sacrifice.\r",
        "Enough talk! Show me how much\n",
        "stronger you have become!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000230_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Tch.\n",
        "Still holding back? Whatever.\r",
        "I have bigger things to solve\n",
        "than a few glowing rocks.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
